      {
        "assertion_id": "reaction-state-protonation-boundary",
        "status": "project_interpretation",
        "statement": "The reviewed M0187 input corresponds to CHEBI:32382, whose retained MOL encodes formal charge -1 on atom10 (source a11). In contrast, both deposited component definitions state C8 H8 O3 and explicitly bond O12 to HO2; O12 maps to that carboxylate oxygen. Dictionary atom charge fields are absent, so a deposited zero charge is not asserted. This prevents exact canonical reaction-state identity; dictionary H does not determine bound protonation.",
        "supporting_selection_ids": [
          "m0187-input-rmn",
          "m0187-input-smn",
          "component-rmn",
          "component-smn"
        ]
      },
      {
        "assertion_id": "reaction-state-stereo-and-maps",
        "status": "project_interpretation",
        "statement": "The two complete depicted-component locator maps retain all11 heavy atoms and explicit alpha H a66. Source-computed a9 R agrees with RMN C7 R and differs from SMN C7 S. One map preserves literal mapped bond orders; the phenyl reflection changes all six ring order tokens. Dictionary aromatic flags are preserved, not used to normalize the source graph. Neither map supplies full hydrogen/stereo state, a physical atom trajectory or a productive reactant pose. The retained source a9-a12 bondStereo W and dictionary C7-O8 bond-stereo N use different conventions and are not compared by this operation; only the reviewed atom R/S symbols are compared.",
        "supporting_selection_ids": [
          "m0187-input-rmn",
          "m0187-input-smn"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "not_established": [
      "A same-site enantiomer control or equivalent catalytic geometry; the site records and deposited connection inventories differ.",
      "Dictionary stereochemical assignments are not coordinate-derived absolute configurations, and dictionary hydrogens are not measured ligand hydrogen coordinates.",
      "Bound protonation, enantiopurity or relative solution populations; occupancy1.00 is a deposited model field.",
      "Physical nonbinding or absent contacts inferred from missing RMN struct_conn rows; this table is not a complete contact inventory.",
      "Observed racemization, productive geometry, a physical atom trajectory, same assay specimen, or an independently validated enzyme mechanism.",
      "The missing1L6F companion is not supplied or qualified by this mandelate comparison.",
      "The prior CE-021 organism/source-origin limits remain unchanged; this comparison does not re-adjudicate them.",
      "Exact identity between the canonical R-mandelate reaction state and either deposited dictionary or coordinate instance; the canonical carboxylate and dictionary O12-HO2 differ, and dictionary/coordinate formal charges are unavailable.",
      "Source a10-Mg and a11-Mg coordinate bonds are outside the selected covalent graph; no source-to-deposit coordination or pose equality is established."
    ]
  },
